        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "chore(deps): bump the swift-deps group across 1 directory with 3 updates",
        "body": "Bumps the swift-deps group with 3 updates in the /apps/macos directory: [github.com/apple/swift-log](https://github.com/apple/swift-log), [github.com/sparkle-project/sparkle](https://github.com/sparkle-project/Sparkle) and [github.com/pointfreeco/swift-concurrency-extras](https://github.com/pointfreeco/swift-concurrency-extras).\n\nUpdates `github.com/apple/swift-log` from 1.13.2 to 1.14.0\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/apple/swift-log/releases\">github.com/apple/swift-log's releases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>1.14.0</h2>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n<h2>What's Changed</h2>\n<h3>SemVer Minor</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>[SLG-0006]: task-local logger implementation by <a href=\"https://github.com/kukushechkin\"><code>@​kukushechkin</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/apple/swift-log/pull/459\">apple/swift-log#459</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Other Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>[SLG-0006]: task-local logger proposal by <a href=\"https://github.com/kukushechkin\"><code>@​kukushechkin</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/apple/swift-log/pull/460\">apple/swift-log#460</a></li>\n<li>Bump actions/checkout from 6 to 7 by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a>[bot] in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/apple/swift-log/pull/472\">apple/swift-log#472</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a href=\"https://github.com/apple/swift-log/compare/1.13.2...1.14.0\">https://github.com/apple/swift-log/compare/1.13.2...1.14.0</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/apple/swift-log/commit/a878e7f8f46cfc0e1125e565b5c08e7d5272dc9a\"><code>a878e7f</code></a> [SLG-0006]: task-local logger implementation (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/apple/swift-log/issues/459\">#459</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/apple/swift-log/commit/2c52ee25d21aee7f204b6aa76f8771447c378202\"><code>2c52ee2</code></a> Bump actions/checkout from 6 to 7 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/apple/swift-log/issues/472\">#472</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/apple/swift-log/commit/ca6118469893201380f29a4d67feb68bcb44fa25\"><code>ca61184</code></a> [SLG-0006]: task-local logger proposal (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/apple/swift-log/issues/460\">#460</a>)</li>\n<li>See full diff in <a href=\"https://github.com/apple/swift-log/compare/1.13.2...1.14.0\">compare view</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\nUpdates `github.com/sparkle-project/sparkle` from 2.9.3 to 2.9.4\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/sparkle-project/Sparkle/releases\">github.com/sparkle-project/sparkle's releases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>2.9.4 Appcast Improvements</h2>\n<p>Changes:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix backgrounded apps sometimes not bringing windows from user initiated actions in active focus (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/sparkle-project/Sparkle/issues/2890\">#2890</a>) (Zorg, wojciech-kulik)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This release contains an activation fix for backgrounded / dockless applications using Sparkle's standard user interface.</p>\n<p>Please also check <a href=\"https://github.com/sparkle-project/Sparkle/releases/tag/2.9.3\">2.9.3</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/sparkle-project/Sparkle/releases/tag/2.9.2\">2.9.2</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/sparkle-project/Sparkle/releases/tag/2.9.1\">2.9.1</a>, and <a href=\"https://github.com/sparkle-project/Sparkle/releases/tag/2.9.0\">2.9.0</a> for previous changes.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sparkle-project/Sparkle/commit/b6496a74a087257ef5e6da1c5b29a447a60f5bd7\"><code>b6496a7</code></a> Update Package management files for version 2.9.4</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sparkle-project/Sparkle/commit/4ba9745eca7186b85c466663e627637cee8f2b1d\"><code>4ba9745</code></a> Update CHANGELOG for version 2.9.4</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sparkle-project/Sparkle/commit/1ec540d5378e6e882a8341c47e682dba0012ee1d\"><code>1ec540d</code></a> Use activateIgnoringOtherApps: again for backgrounded apps (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/sparkle-project/Sparkle/issues/2890\">#2890</a>)</li>\n<li>See full diff in <a href=\"https://github.com/sparkle-project/Sparkle/compare/2.9.3...2.9.4\">compare view</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\nUpdates `github.com/pointfreeco/swift-concurrency-extras` from 1.3.2 to 1.4.0\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/pointfreeco/swift-concurrency-extras/releases\">github.com/pointfreeco/swift-concurrency-extras's releases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>1.4.0</h2>\n<h2>What's Changed</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Added: A new <code>ConcurrencyExtrasTestSupport</code> module with <code>TaskLocalTrait</code> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pointfreeco/swift-concurrency-extras/pull/65\">pointfreeco/swift-concurrency-extras#65</a>).</li>\n<li>Fixed: <code>Result.init(catching:)</code> is now <code>nonisolated(nonsending)</code> (thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/rhysm94\"><code>@​rhysm94</code></a>, <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pointfreeco/swift-concurrency-extras/pull/61\">pointfreeco/swift-concurrency-extras#61</a>).</li>\n<li>Fixed: Enable <code>NonisolatedNonsendingByDefault</code> (thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/davdroman\"><code>@​davdroman</code></a>, <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pointfreeco/swift-concurrency-extras/pull/64\">pointfreeco/swift-concurrency-extras#64</a>).</li>\n<li>Infrastructure: Simplify Android CI (thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/marcprux\"><code>@​marcprux</code></a>, <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pointfreeco/swift-concurrency-extras/pull/53\">pointfreeco/swift-concurrency-extras#53</a>).</li>\n<li>Infrastructure: Bump package versioning requirements (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pointfreeco/swift-concurrency-extras/pull/58\">pointfreeco/swift-concurrency-extras#58</a>).</li>\n<li>Infrastructure: Update format.yml (thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/rhysm94\"><code>@​rhysm94</code></a>, <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pointfreeco/swift-concurrency-extras/pull/62\">pointfreeco/swift-concurrency-extras#62</a>).</li>\n<li>Infrastructure: Bump CI (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pointfreeco/swift-concurrency-extras/pull/63\">pointfreeco/swift-concurrency-extras#63</a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>New Contributors</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/marcprux\"><code>@​marcprux</code></a> made their first contribution in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pointfreeco/swift-concurrency-extras/pull/53\">pointfreeco/swift-concurrency-extras#53</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/rhysm94\"><code>@​rhysm94</code></a> made their first contribution in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pointfreeco/swift-concurrency-extras/pull/61\">pointfreeco/swift-concurrency-extras#61</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/davdroman\"><code>@​davdroman</code></a> made their first contribution in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pointfreeco/swift-concurrency-extras/pull/64\">pointfreeco/swift-concurrency-extras#64</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a href=\"https://github.com/pointfreeco/swift-concurrency-extras/compare/1.3.2...1.4.0\">https://github.com/pointfreeco/swift-concurrency-extras/compare/1.3.2...1.4.0</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/pointfreeco/swift-concurrency-extras/commit/a90e2e40a7a840a853dd29e57cbef5dbb72c9d5b\"><code>a90e2e4</code></a> Add <code>ConcurrencyExtrasTestSupport</code> with <code>TaskLocalTrait</code> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pointfreeco/swift-concurrency-extras/issues/65\">#65</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/pointfreeco/swift-concurrency-extras/commit/5766c2e1f581fc9702a881ec3ff08371d88e637c\"><code>5766c2e</code></a> Cleanup</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/pointfreeco/swift-concurrency-extras/commit/5d81c23fdb9715201c4015a1973ea7ab6bc06b37\"><code>5d81c23</code></a> Enable <code>NonisolatedNonsendingByDefault</code> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pointfreeco/swift-concurrency-extras/issues/64\">#64</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/pointfreeco/swift-concurrency-extras/commit/f9db8422fa13f554987eba71887f9652c4a46b9b\"><code>f9db842</code></a> Remove documentation workflow</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/pointfreeco/swift-concurrency-extras/commit/f7b9b8c62ed2533bf8ad1665ccd9e7a682c54d8f\"><code>f7b9b8c</code></a> Bump CI (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pointfreeco/swift-concurrency-extras/issues/63\">#63</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/pointfreeco/swift-concurrency-extras/commit/e516f471ebfac46b04c22af03dcfcc25f48af760\"><code>e516f47</code></a> Run swift-format</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/pointfreeco/swift-concurrency-extras/commit/cb9c6e00c5c9691d905c4c460913e82ee45ac39e\"><code>cb9c6e0</code></a> Update format.yml (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pointfreeco/swift-concurrency-extras/issues/62\">#62</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/pointfreeco/swift-concurrency-extras/commit/45bfc4e93340888206b247005a8224ab2e10b6e9\"><code>45bfc4e</code></a> Run swift-format</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/pointfreeco/swift-concurrency-extras/commit/5fe9f3bdc0ade508cfbee611119ec87cc1c414f2\"><code>5fe9f3b</code></a> <code>nonisolated(nonsending)</code> Result <code>init</code> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pointfreeco/swift-concurrency-extras/issues/61\">#61</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/pointfreeco/swift-concurrency-extras/commit/d74eaaa106e66184655982433b10a2f2dffbe2ac\"><code>d74eaaa</code></a> Update package versioning (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/pointfreeco/swift-concurrency-extras/issues/58\">#58</a>)</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a href=\"https://github.com/pointfreeco/swift-concurrency-extras/compare/1.3.2...1.4.0\">compare view</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n",
